  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Assistance to Conflict affected people is Sudan and support to the enabling Environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds the Mercy Corps-led Cash Consortium of Sudan (CCS) to deliver cash assistance both to conflict-affected individuals and also local action groups to enable beneficiaries to meet their basic needs. Support is also provided to the wider enabling environment to improve detection of malnutrition and security information.</narrative>
  </description>
